<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company evaluated the acquired set under ASC 805
and concluded that it did not meet the definition of a business. Accordingly, the transaction was accounted for as an asset acquisition
under ASC 805-50 rather than as a business combination.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
purchase price for this transaction consisted of <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued_pid_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember_zVszQSc3S2C4" title="Shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestsIssuedOrIssuableNumberOfSharesIssued" contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember" id="Fact001474" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">12,670,257</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock issued at closing, valued at approximately $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestIssuedOrIssuableValueAssigned_iI_pn5n6_c20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember_z9gR4dtRvuF" title="Closing value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionEquityInterestIssuedOrIssuableValueAssigned" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember" id="Fact001476" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">12.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
million. We also granted the sellers the right to two earn-out payments in the amount of the first earnout of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues_pn5n6_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--FirstEarnoutMember_zCdzkYwJIxCh" title="Shares value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_FirstEarnoutMember" id="Fact001478" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">15.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
million (payable in <span id="xdx_900_ecustom--BusinessAcquisitionTerm_iI_pid_dtY_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--FirstEarnoutMember_zfBw9MdoYeSd" title="Business acquisition term" style="display: none"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_FirstEarnoutMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001480" name="AIFC:BusinessAcquisitionTerm">5</ix:nonNumeric></span>five
(5)-year pre-funded warrants exercisable for up to <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--FirstEarnoutMember_zKan9K3GM0r1" title="Shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_FirstEarnoutMember" id="Fact001482" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">15,837,821</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of common stock with an initial aggregate exercise price of $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice_iI_pn5n6_c20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--FirstEarnoutMember_zpKvoicsJvi5" title="Aggregate exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_custom_FirstEarnoutMember" id="Fact001484" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USDPShares">15.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
million) at the point in time if, or when, Block Street generates US GAAP-compliant net revenues, applied consistently with the
Company&#8217;s historical accounting policies, of not less than $20.0 million on a trailing four-quarter reporting basis. The
second earnout of approximately $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues_pn5n6_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--SecondEarnoutMember_zHYfCmYRXjm5" title="Shares value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_custom_SecondEarnoutMember" id="Fact001486" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">16.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
million payable in <span id="xdx_906_ecustom--BusinessAcquisitionTerm_iI_pid_dtY_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--SecondEarnoutMember_zzPFk7XmAXSk" title="Business acquisition term" style="display: none"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecondEarnoutMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact001488" name="AIFC:BusinessAcquisitionTerm">5</ix:nonNumeric></span>five
(5)-year pre-funded warrants exercisable for up to <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_pid_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--StatementEquityComponentsAxis__us-gaap--CommonStockMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--SecondEarnoutMember_zADGwW6cewra" title="Shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_custom_SecondEarnoutMember" id="Fact001490" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">16,893,675</ix:nonFraction></span>
shares of common stock with an initial aggregate exercise price of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice_iI_pn5n6_c20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember__us-gaap--VestingAxis__custom--SecondEarnoutMember_zAW8DFA6rUI6" title="Aggregate exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessAcquisitionSharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember_custom_SecondEarnoutMember" id="Fact001492" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USDPShares">16.0</ix:nonFraction></span>
million) at the point in time if, or when, Block Street generates US GAAP-compliant Modified Operating Income, defined in the SEA as
Net Operating Income plus realized gains minus realized losses from token sale operations, of not less than $8.0 million on a
trailing four-quarter reporting basis.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
fair value of the purchase price components outlined above was $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable_pn5n6_c20260420__20260420__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--BlockStreetCorpMember_z3GqQ43gKscj" title="Business acquisition, shares issued, fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestsIssuedAndIssuable" contextRef="From2026-04-202026-04-20_custom_BlockStreetCorpMember" id="Fact001494" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">11.7</ix:nonFraction></span> million due to fair value adjustments for the contingent consideration,
cash acquired, and working capital adjustments, as detailed below (in $000&#8217;s):</span></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-12-28to2026-06-27" escape="true" id="Fact001496" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89A_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock_zXzjTteDKUw2" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;<span id="xdx_8B7_zEVYlWJi75ga" style="display: none">Schedule
