<p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><i><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proforma Information</span></i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span style="font-style: normal; font-weight: normal">The
table below presents selected proforma information for the Company for the 13 and 26 weeks ended June 28, 2025, assuming that the acquisition
had occurred on December 31, 2023 (the beginning of the Company&#8217;s 2024 fiscal year), pursuant to ASC 805-10-50. This proforma information
does not purport to represent what the actual results of operations of the Company would have been had the acquisition occurred on that
date, nor does it purport to predict the results of operations for fut<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ure
periods (in $000&#8217;s).</span></span></p>

