<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Company accounts for purchased goodwill and intangible assets in accordance with ASC 350, Intangibles&#8212;Goodwill and Other. Goodwill
recognized during the 39 weeks ended September 27, 2025 was approximately $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--GoodwillPeriodIncreaseDecrease_pn5n6_c20241229__20250927_zSTFNmI3A9ua" title="Goodwill recognized"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:GoodwillPeriodIncreaseDecrease" contextRef="From2024-12-292025-09-27" id="Fact002062" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">8.4</ix:nonFraction></span> million, and was due to the acquisition of Mswipe (see
Note 3).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>


