</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A4_zrOjQnDrHcka" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ALT5
Subsidiary issued <span id="xdx_904_ecustom--DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesIssued_dc_uInteger_c20181001__20190930_z7DkZvRfst62" title="Number of debentures issued"><ix:nonFraction name="AIFC:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesIssued" contextRef="From2018-10-012019-09-30" id="Fact002114" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">seven</ix:nonFraction></span> debentures over a period from October 2018 through September 2019. The debentures bear interest at <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage_iI_pid_dp_uPure_c20251227__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--A12DebenturesMaturingJune302025Member__us-gaap--LongtermDebtTypeAxis__custom--DebenturesMember_zTNCSzTtnZgh" title="Debt interest rate (as percent)"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-27_custom_A12DebenturesMaturingJune302025Member_custom_DebenturesMember" id="Fact002116" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">12</ix:nonFraction></span>% per annum
and matured on June 30, 2025.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
March 2026, <span id="xdx_90B_ecustom--DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesRepaid_dc_uInteger_c20251228__20260328_zsCwTlLMpyKg" title="Number of debentures repaid"><ix:nonFraction name="AIFC:DebtInstrumentNumberOfDebenturesRepaid" contextRef="From2025-12-282026-03-28" id="Fact002118" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF" unitRef="Integer">six</ix:nonFraction></span> of the debentures, representing approximately $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--RepaymentsOfDebt_pn5n6_c20251228__20260328_zlDRGNOT10fl" title="Repayments of debt"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfDebt" contextRef="From2025-12-282026-03-28" id="Fact002120" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million of the aggregate principal amount, were settled through the
issuance of <span id="xdx_90F_ecustom--IssuanceOfSharesOfCommonStock_pid_uShares_c20251228__20260328_zMEdTaBVbABl" title="Issuance of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="AIFC:IssuanceOfSharesOfCommonStock" contextRef="From2025-12-282026-03-28" id="Fact002122" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">114,328</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock. The remaining balance is currently being negotiated for settlement with
the sole remaining holder.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

